invalid type: string "Source PDF: Udaipur itinerary .pdf\nDay - 3 \nUdaipur to Mount Abu & Delhi Departure \nStart your journey from Delhi with a\ncomfortable drive or train ride to\nUdaipur, where you can explore the\nbeautiful lakes and palaces. After a day\nof sightseeing, continue towards Mount\nAbu, the only hill station in Rajasthan,\nknown for its cool climate and scenic\nd glasses,\nÿÿÿÿÿÿ